title: Gossip
color: blue
position: 200,200
---
<<once>>
Tweety: Did you hear? She's absent again. 
Pierrot: I'd be shocked if she graduates.
Tweety: Seriously. Such a delinquent. Someone like her shouldn't walk with the rest of the students.
Pierrot: Agreed. Aren't you worried, Miss Casey?
-> Casey: She's improving.
    Pierrot: If I were you, I'd be more worried. I mean, I take my reputation seriously.
    Tweety: Clearly, not everyone does...
-> Casey: Yes, I am.
    Pierrot: You should be.
<<else>>
<<once>>
Tweety: As much as I'd love to chat, I must go to class.
Pierrot: Shouldn't you be off too, Miss Casey?
<<else>>
Pierrot: Shouldn't you be off too, Miss Casey?
<<endonce>>
<<endonce>>
